WEBVTT

00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:30.309
of what it is that your team
are putting forward.

00:03:30.333 --> 00:03:32.976
First of all --

00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:38.393
Just the problem itself
of how we get the economy going again,

00:03:38.417 --> 00:03:40.601
just talk a bit
about what's at stake there,

00:03:40.625 --> 00:03:42.768
because sometimes this is framed as

00:03:42.792 --> 00:03:44.809
"The economy? Who cares about the economy?

00:03:44.833 --> 00:03:46.434
People's lives are at stake.

00:03:46.458 --> 00:03:49.351
So let's just focus on that,
don't worry about the economy."

00:03:49.375 --> 00:03:50.934
But it's not as simple as that.

00:03:50.958 --> 00:03:52.268
I mean, as an ethicist,

00:03:52.292 --> 00:03:55.250
what's at stake if we don't restart
the economy somehow?

00:03:56.375 --> 00:03:59.018
DA: Well we have to recognize
that we've actually faced

00:03:59.042 --> 00:04:01.559
two existential threats simultaneously.